cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it (and the project-level registry) as follows."
title: "surrogate-cl: load-bearing substrate validation on the Cortical Labs contract"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop experiment scaffold validating that a task function trained
  in-silico survives a simulated culture substrate through the Cortical Labs
  contract (cl-sdk), measured with mutual information, transfer entropy and a
  physical authority envelope on a Unitree G1 humanoid in MuJoCo.
keywords:
  - neuromorphic computing
  - spiking neural networks
  - wetware
  - closed-loop control
  - humanoid locomotion
  - mutual information
  - transfer entropy
license: MIT
